### Customer API Test File
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api (Next.js proxy) or http://localhost:8080/api (direct backend)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@branchId = 1
@tableId = 1

### 1. Start Customer Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/session/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "branchId": {{branchId}},
  "tableId": {{tableId}}
}

### 2. Get Customer Menu
GET {{baseUrl}}/customer/menu?branchId={{branchId}}&tableId={{tableId}}

### 3. Create Customer Order
### Note: Replace {guestSessionId} with actual session ID from step 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestSessionId": "session-1234567890-abc123",
  "branchId": {{branchId}},
  "tableId": {{tableId}},
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": 1,
      "qty": 2
    },
    {
      "menuItemId": 2,
      "qty": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 4. End Customer Session
### Note: Replace {guestSessionId} with actual session ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/session/end
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestSessionId": "session-1234567890-abc123"
}

### 5. Generate QR Code for Table
GET {{baseUrl}}/qr/table/{{branchId}}/{{tableId}}

